{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32238","headline":"却经商山寄昔同行人 · 温庭筠","name":"却经商山寄昔同行人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾道逍遥第一篇，尔来无处不恬然。\n便同南郭能忘象，兼笑东林学坐禅。\n人事转新花烂熳，客程依旧水潺湲。\n若敎犹作当时意，应有垂丝在鬓边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32238.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32238","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}